openspec/changes/traceability-01-index-and-orphans/proposal.md:As the number of requirements, specs, and code modules grows, manually tracking traceability becomes impossible. Teams need a fast, queryable index that maps every artifact to its upstream/downstream counterparts — and actively detects orphans (artifacts with broken or missing links). This index is the backbone for the full-chain validation, coverage dashboards, and ceremony enrichment. Without it, traceability is a write-once artifact that decays the moment someone adds a new endpoint without linking it.
